  "ruleText": "He-P 802.30 Emergency Preparedness. Each facility shall comply with all applicable federal, state, and local emergency preparedness requirements including 42 CFR 482.15.\n\nSource. #9580, eff 10-24-09; ss by #12407, INTERIM, eff 10-24-17, EXPIRED: 4-22-18\n\nNew. #13166, eff 1-28-21; ss by #14081, eff 9-25-24, EXPIRES: 9-25-34 (formerly He-P 802.29)",
